  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase Black 1.24 is a premium multifilament string designed to deliver gut-like comfort, feel and power while offering improved durability and tension maintenance. The combination of Elastyl and H²C fibres with PU400 polyurethane and the exclusive Biphase pre-stretch process creates exceptional elasticity and long-lasting performance. A silicone surface finish improves string movement and includes a visible wear indicator to help players know when restringing is needed.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase Black 1.24 是一款高端多芯球线，以接近天然肠线的舒适性、力量和击球反馈著称，同时拥有更好的耐久性和保磅表现。采用 50% Elastyl 高弹纤维、50% H²C 高耐热纤维、PU400 聚氨酯整体浸润以及独有的 Biphase 双向预拉伸工艺制造，使球线兼具力量、舒适性与长期性能。表面硅胶涂层改善球线滑动，并加入磨损指示设计，当出现明显起毛时即可判断需要重新穿线。"
  },

